# Mascot source renders: 40 MB of 1024px pairs. The cut-out webp files in
# src/assets/mascot are committed; regenerate them with scripts/mascot.mjs.
design/mascot-originals/
design/preview/
out/

# Python bytecode from scripts/matte.py — regenerated on every run.
__pycache__/

# Local build configuration.
#
# The VAPID *public* key lives here and is harmless — it ends up in the bundle
# either way. The rule exists for the key that must never be near it: a private
# signing key pasted into the wrong line of the wrong file is committed before
# anyone notices, and rotating one means every reminder subscription dies.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
